needs = ""
description = "Opening, passive, melee. Every guard breaks. Every fighter falters. A true warrior sees it, and ends it. While fighting in melee, or when you block an attack with a shield, you sometimes spot a fatal flaw in an enemy's defence. Strike it within 1.5 seconds to execute a brutal finishing move suited to your weapon. Guaranteed critical hit (+%d%% damage), +%d%% item drop chance, refills 25%% of every power's charge. Against champions: shatters their defining strength. Rank up to spot Openings more often and strike harder."
